{
  "name" : "FileContent",
  "description" : "Inline byte storage for small files (under ~10 MB). Versioned bytea blobs indexed by sourceClass + sourceId, used when bucket storage is overkill. ACL is read-only via generic CRUD: content writes go through FileController (save-content, content), which keeps the version + File2 metadata in sync.",
